{"metadata":{"symbolKind":"struct","role":"symbol","title":"OpenURLAction","externalID":"s:11OpenSwiftUI0A9URLActionV","roleHeading":"Structure","modules":[{"name":"OpenSwiftUI"}],"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OpenURLAction","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"OpenURLAction","kind":"identifier"}]},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"abstract":[{"text":"An action that opens a URL.","type":"text"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI"]]},"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","relationshipsSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/s8CopyableP","doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/SQ","doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/s9EscapableP"],"type":"conformsTo","kind":"relationships","title":"Conforms To"}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/OpenURLAction"},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/openswiftui\/openurlaction"]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OpenURLAction","kind":"identifier"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"content":[{"anchor":"overview","level":2,"text":"Overview","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Read the ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/EnvironmentValues\/openURL","isActive":true},{"text":" environment value to get an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"instance of this structure for a given ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Environment","isActive":true},{"text":". Call the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"instance to open a URL. You call the instance directly because it","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"defines a ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/OpenURLAction\/callAsFunction(_:)","isActive":true},{"text":" method that Swift","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"calls when you call the instance.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"For example, you can open a web site when the user taps a button:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":null,"code":["struct OpenURLExample: View {","    @Environment(\\.openURL) private var openURL","","    var body: some View {","        Button {","            if let url = URL(string: \"https:\/\/www.example.com\") {","                openURL(url)","            }","        } label: {","            Label(\"Get Help\", systemImage: \"person.fill.questionmark\")","        }","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"If you want to know whether the action succeeds, add a completion","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"handler that takes a Boolean value. In this case, Swift implicitly","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"calls the ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/OpenURLAction\/callAsFunction(_:completion:)","isActive":true},{"text":" method","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"instead. That method calls your completion handler after it determines","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"whether it can open the URL, but possibly before it finishes opening","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the URL. You can add a handler to the example above so that","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"it prints the outcome to the console:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":null,"code":["openURL(url) { accepted in","    print(accepted ? \"Success\" : \"Failure\")","}"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The system provides a default open URL action with behavior","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"that depends on the contents of the URL. For example, the default","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"action opens a Universal Link in the associated app if possible,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"or in the user’s default web browser if not.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"You can also set a custom action using the ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/View\/environment(_:_:)","isActive":true},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"view modifier. Any views that read the action from the environment,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"including the built-in ","type":"text"},{"code":"Link","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" view and ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Text","isActive":true},{"text":" views with markdown","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"links, or links in attributed strings, use your action. Initialize an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"action by calling the ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/OpenURLAction\/init(handler:)","isActive":true},{"text":" initializer with","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"a handler that takes a URL and returns an ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/OpenURLAction\/Result","isActive":true},{"text":":","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":null,"code":["Text(\"Visit [Example Company](https:\/\/www.example.com) for details.\")","    .environment(\\.openURL, OpenURLAction { url in","        handleURL(url) \/\/ Define this method to take appropriate action.","        return .handled","    })"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"OpenSwiftUI translates the value that your custom action’s handler","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"returns into an appropriate Boolean result for the action call.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"For example, a view that uses the action declared above","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"receives ","type":"text"},{"code":"true","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" when calling the action, because the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"handler always returns ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/OpenURLAction\/Result\/handled","isActive":true},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/OpenURLAction\/Result"],"anchor":"Structures","title":"Structures","generated":true},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/OpenURLAction\/init(handler:)"],"anchor":"Initializers","title":"Initializers","generated":true},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/OpenURLAction\/callAsFunction(_:)","doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/OpenURLAction\/callAsFunction(_:completion:)"],"anchor":"Instance-Methods","title":"Instance Methods","generated":true},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/OpenURLAction\/Equatable-Implementations"],"anchor":"Default-Implementations","title":"Default Implementations","generated":true}],"references":{"doc://OpenSwiftUI/documentation/OpenSwiftUI/OpenURLAction/Equatable-Implementations":{"abstract":[],"type":"topic","role":"collectionGroup","kind":"article","url":"\/documentation\/openswiftui\/openurlaction\/equatable-implementations","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/OpenURLAction\/Equatable-Implementations","title":"Equatable Implementations"},"doc://OpenSwiftUI/documentation/OpenSwiftUI/OpenURLAction/callAsFunction(_:completion:)":{"abstract":[{"text":"Asynchronously opens a URL,